	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07_hakase2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『さて　あなたを
ここまで　つれてきた　りゆうを▽
せつめい　しないとね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:15:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T11:41:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ『さて　あなたを
ここまで　連れてきた　理由を▽
説明しないとね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:40:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T11:42:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：WHITE
・t07r0101からでるとイベント開始
・アララギ、下向きのままで
　一歩ほど離れている？
・ベルもそばで聞いている
・続けてhakase2_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T07:41:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T06:13:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
