		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうよね
それが　しぜんの　はんのう　だわ▼
プラズマだんなんかと　かかわりあいに
ならないのが　いちばん　よ▼
でもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:53:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:19:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうよね
それが　自然の　反応だわ▼
プラズマ団なんかと　係わり合いに
ならないのが　一番よ▼
でもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:53:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:50:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・いいえ選択時
・続けてhakase2_08
　ウインドウを閉じずに</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:53:48" />
		</CommentCell>
